{"id": "71761", "title": "冥婚鬼嫁", "author": "地下判官", "category": "都市言情", "count": 30, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/71/71761/71761s.jpg", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/71/71761.htm", "intro": "误闯阴轿，被鬼缠身！\n    萌鬼老公太傲娇，非要和我上演人鬼恋\n    俗话说，咱惹不起，咱就躲，可是…\n    每到午夜，是谁的手抚遍你全身，是谁的呼吸在你的鼻翼间缠绵悱恻？\n    女人都是感性的，在这么火辣的午夜下，失身又失心的我，竟然怀了冥胎…\n    男人冰冷的指尖覆在我得腹部，笑的温柔妖冶，“纱耶，快回来吧！”\n    原来我至始至终都是一枚棋子，一个让他深爱的女人复活的容器…", "base": "files/article/html/71/71761", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "001 误闯阴轿", "file": "11271548.html", "available": false}, {"title": "002 一把檀木梳", "file": "11271549.html", "available": false}, {"title": "003 诡异的喜轿", "file": "11271550.html", "available": false}, {"title": "004 神秘的黑影", "file": "11271551.html", "available": false}, {"title": "005 白色喜轿", "file": "11271552.html", "available": false}, {"title": "006 阴轿碰撞？", "file": "11271553.html", "available": false}, {"title": "007 二妞的死（1）", "file": "11271554.html", "available": false}, {"title": "008 二妞的死（2）", "file": "11271555.html", "available": false}, {"title": "009 小瓷，救我（1）", "file": "11271556.html", "available": false}, {"title": "010 小瓷，救我（2）", "file": "11271557.html", "available": false}, {"title": "011 小瓷，救我（3）", "file": "11271558.html", "available": false}, {"title": "012 小瓷，救我（4）", "file": "11271559.html", "available": false}, {"title": "013 小瓷，救我（5）", "file": "11271560.html", "available": false}, {"title": "014 小瓷，救我（6）", "file": "11273146.html", "available": false}, {"title": "015 孟尹阑", "file": "11274589.html", "available": false}, {"title": "016 想要摆脱我？ 为喵喵_招代理加更", "file": "11276093.html", "available": false}, {"title": "017 万鬼迎亲？", "file": "11276462.html", "available": false}, {"title": "018 苏兮寒", "file": "11277971.html", "available": false}, {"title": "019 小瓷，救我（7）", "file": "11277972.html", "available": true}, {"title": "020 小瓷，救我（8） 为收藏满了一千一百加更", "file": "11278316.html", "available": true}, {"title": "021 小瓷，救我（9）", "file": "11279056.html", "available